---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: KPI Diagnostic
description: "A two-minute diagnostic for a KPI that turned red: find out whether the cause is clarity, skill, capacity, process design or ownership."
activeNav: /tools.html
permalink: /tools/kpi-diagnostic/
---
<section class="shell page-hero tool-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Free tool · 2 minutes</p>
  <h1>KPI Diagnostic</h1>
  <p class="lede">A number turned red. Before you push harder on it, find where the process first became unstable. Rate ten statements about the work behind the number.</p>
</section>

<section class="shell tool-layout">
  <form class="tool-panel diagnostic" data-diagnostic novalidate>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="kpi-name">Which KPI? <span class="optional">optional</span></label>
      <input id="kpi-name" name="kpi" placeholder="e.g. Delivery delays, room readiness, picking errors" autocomplete="off">
    </div>

    <ol class="statement-list">
      {%- for s in kpiDiagnostic.statements %}
      {%- set qi = loop.index0 %}
      <li>
        <fieldset class="statement">
          <legend><span class="statement-number">{{ loop.index | pad }}</span>{{ s.text }}</legend>
          <div class="scale">
            {%- for label in kpiDiagnostic.scale %}
            <label class="scale-option">
              <input type="radio" name="q{{ qi }}" value="{{ loop.index0 }}" data-cause="{{ s.cause }}">
              <span>{{ label }}</span>
            </label>
            {%- endfor %}
          </div>
        </fieldset>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ol>

    <div class="tool-actions">
      <button class="button-primary" type="submit">See the result</button>
      <p class="form-note" data-progress aria-live="polite">0 of {{ kpiDiagnostic.statements.length }} answered</p>
    </div>
  </form>

  <aside class="tool-aside">
    <p class="kicker">How it works</p>
    <p>Each statement points to one of five causes from the essay <a class="inline-link" href="/article-kpi.html">The KPI is not the problem</a>: clarity, skill, capacity, process design and ownership.</p>
    <p>The result shows which cause fits your situation best, with three first moves and one question to ask on the floor.</p>
    <p class="privacy-note">Everything stays in your browser. Nothing you enter is sent or stored.</p>
  </aside>
</section>

<section class="shell tool-result" data-result hidden tabindex="-1" aria-live="polite"></section>

<script type="application/json" id="kpi-diagnostic-data">{{ kpiDiagnostic | dump | safe }}</script>
<script src="/js/kpi-diagnostic.js" defer></script>
